{
  "name": "Enchanted Shots",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the ability to infuse projectiles with magic. Whenever you make a ranged weapon attack with a nonmagical weapon, you can make it magical for the purpose of overcoming Resistance and Immunity to nonmagical attacks and damage.</p><p>Additionally, whenever you make a ranged weapon attack, you can change the damage type to any other damage type of your choice except bludgeoning, piercing, or slashing.</p>",
